\">전체 현황 — 지수 · 환율 카드와 알고리즘별 할당 자산</figcaption></figure><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">백엔드를 켜지 않고 프론트엔드만 띄워 캡처했기 때문에 목록은 비어 있고, 전체 현황의 지수 값은 화면 확인용 예시 값입니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">화면 흐름 (작업 순서)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 space-y-2 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50/70 p-3 sm:p-4 overflow-x-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 min-w-max\"><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">설정</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">API 키 · 계좌</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">데이터</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">수집 · 가공 · 확인</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">알고리즘</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">등록 · 검증</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold text-indigo-600 leading-none mb-0.5\">조합</span><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-white px-