rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">디자인 컨셉 — 다크 Glassmorphism</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">용도</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">색</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">의도</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">배경</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:4px;background:#0b0f19;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.15)\"></span><code>#0b0f19</code></span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">아주 어두운 남색 — 숫자와 차트가 도드라지도록</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">패널</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(22,28,45,.6);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.15)\"></span><code>rgba(22,28,45,.6)</code></span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">반투명 유리 패널(Glassmorphism) + 얇은 흰 테두리(8%)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">강조</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:4px;background:#3b82f6;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.15)\"></span><code>#3b82f6</code></span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">선택된 메뉴 · 주 버튼 · 아이콘</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">상승 · 수익</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:4px;background:#ff4b72;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.15)\"></span><code>#ff4b72</code></span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">국내 증시 관례대로 빨강 = 상승</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">하락 · 손실</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:4px;background:#2f80ed;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.15)\"></span><code>#2f80ed</code></span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">파랑 = 하락</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">위험 동작</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:4px;background:#f44336;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.15)\"></span><code>#f44336</code></span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">긴급 일괄 매도처럼 되돌릴 수 없는 버튼은 빨간 면 버튼으로 분리</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">실행 · 추가</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:4px;background:#00e676;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.15)\"></span><code>#00e676</code></span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">신규 구동 추가 같은 '만들기' 동작은 초록</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">디자인 원칙</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">레이아웃</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">상단 = 큰 메뉴 7개(작업 순서대로), 왼쪽 = 그 메뉴의 세부 화면, 가운데 = 작업 영역. 어느 화면에서든 같은 3단 틀</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">작업 순서 = 메뉴 순서</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">설정 → 데이터 → 알고리즘 → 구동 설정 → 시뮬레이션 → 주식 실행 → 전체 현황. 왼쪽에서 오른쪽으로 가면 실전에 가까워짐</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">상태는 항상 보이게</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">우측 상단에 키움 API 연결 상태 배지, 실행 화면 제목 아래 장 상태(개장 · 마감) 표시</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">감시 화면은 2열</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">왼쪽 = 세션 · 매수 후보 · 잔고 표, 오른쪽 = 터미널 형태의 실시간 분석 · 체결 로그</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">빈 상태 안내</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">데이터가 없을 때는 빈 표 대신 '무엇을 먼저 하면 되는지' 문구를 표 안에 보여줌</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">글꼴 · 아이콘</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Inter + Noto Sans KR, Font Awesome 6 아이콘으로 메뉴 · 카드 제목을 구분</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">시스템 구상</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 space-y-2 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50/70 p-3 sm:p-4 overflow-x-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 min-w-max\"><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">프론트엔드</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">React · 설정 · 모니터링</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold text-indigo-600 leading-none mb-0.5\">REST / WebSocket</span><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">메인 백엔드 (64-bit)</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">알고리즘 · 구동 케이스 · 스케줄러</span></span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 min-w-max\"><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">메인 백엔드</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold text-indigo-600 leading-none mb-0.5\">HTTP</span><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">데이터 서버 (64-bit)</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">DuckDB · Parquet 수집 · 가공</span></span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 min-w-max\"><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">메인 백엔드</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold text-indigo-600 leading-none mb-0.5\">HTTP / JSON</span><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">키움 브릿지 (32-bit)</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">FastAPI</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold text-indigo-600 leading-none mb-0.5\">ActiveX</span><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">키움 OpenAPI+</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">증권사</span></span></div></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">서비스</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">기술</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">역할</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">프론트엔드</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">React 18 + Vite, react-router-dom 6, Plotly 차트</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">설정 · 모니터링 · 전략 튜닝 · 시뮬레이션 결과 확인</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">메인 백엔드 (64-bit)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">FastAPI</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">중앙 통제 — 알고리즘 · 구동 케이스 저장, 스케줄러, 매매 판단</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">데이터 서버 (64-bit)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">FastAPI + DuckDB / Parquet</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">시세 · 시가총액 · 뉴스 수집과 가공 · 적재</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">키움 브릿지 (32-bit)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">FastAPI + 키움 OpenAPI+ (ActiveX)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">32비트 전용 증권사 API 를 JSON API 로 바꿔 메인 백엔드에 전달</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">키움 OpenAPI+ 는 32비트 Windows ActiveX 로만 동작하기 때문에, 증권사 통신만 32비트 브릿지 서버로 떼어 내고 데이터 분석 · 매매 판단은 64비트 서버에서 하도록 나눴습니다. 프론트엔드는 메인 백엔드와 데이터 서버만 바라봅니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">핵심 개념</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">개념</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설명</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">알고리즘</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">매매 신호를 내는 단위. 마스터 목록에 등록하고, 받을 수 있는 파라미터를 스키마로 정의</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">구동 케이스</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">알고리즘 하나 또는 여러 개를 단일 · 가중 · 순차로 조합하고 배정 자산 · 손절 기준을 붙인 실행 단위</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">시뮬레이션</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">구동 케이스를 과거 기간에 돌려 보는 백테스트와, 장중에 가상 계좌로 돌려 보는 모의 매매 두 가지</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">세션</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">실제로 가동 중인 구동 케이스. 실행 화면에서 매수 후보 · 보유 잔고 · 체결 로그를 세션별로 확인</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">안전장치</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">전략이 산 종목만 따로 보는 잔고 탭, 장 상태 표시, 보유 종목 긴급 일괄 매도 버튼</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">진행 단계</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">단계</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">상태</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">1단계 · 기반</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">32-bit / 64-bit Python 환경 분리, 저장 구조 설계</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">완료</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">2단계 · UI · 통신</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">대시보드 레이아웃, 키움 브릿지 서버와 로그인 연동</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">완료</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">3단계 · 전략</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">예시 전략(MACD 스윙 · RSI 단타)과 파라미터 설정 UI</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">완료</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">4단계 · 계좌 · 이력</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">전체 잔고 / 전략별 매수분 분리 보기, 체결 이력 표</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">완료</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">5단계 · 안정화</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">새벽 토큰 갱신 · 대상 종목 선정 스케줄러, 오류 로그 모니터링, 긴급 일괄 매도</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">진행 중</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/projects/autotrader","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"projects","title":"프로젝트","path":"it/projects"}],"hasImage":false}